  "security_implications": "This chunk drives edn_req, which initiates an EDN (entropy) request for key reseeding in the keymgr. A lost or delayed reseed request (e.g. due to edn_done priority over concurrent reseed_req_i/local_req) could cause the key-manager to continue using old entropy, undermining forward-secrecy and key rotation security. The signals reseed_req_i, local_req, edn_req and edn_done directly influence the freshness of cryptographic key material.",
